This package provides custom event enrichment for the Amplitude Browser SDK.

When a customer enables custom enrichment, the SDK receives a JavaScript function
body through Amplitude remote configuration and evaluates it in the browser. The
function can change an analytics event before the SDK sends it. This lets the
customer apply their own event enrichment logic without shipping a new version
of their application.

Evaluating remotely configured JavaScript is a security-sensitive capability.
The intended use is to run enrichment code configured by the customer for their
own application. It is not intended to run code from untrusted third parties.
